      55.25,
      476.22,
      549.78,
      529.29
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 2 of the Census Ordinance (Chapter 143), I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Economic Development, Policy Formulation, Planning and Tourism, direct that the third stage of the Census of Population and Housing \u2013 2024, collection data of individuals and housing units of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka be taken in the end part of the year 2024.",
