    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      239.3,
      338.22,
      349.18,
      349.29
    ],
    "text": "PART I - PRELIMINARY",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      366.22,
      403.43,
      377.29
    ],
    "text": "1. These rules shall be cited as the Population and Housing Census Rules 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      394.22,
      542.5,
      475.29
    ],
    "text": "2. In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires, \u2018ordinance\u2019 means the Census Ordinance (Chapter 143); \u2018Superintendent\u2019 means the Superintendent of Census, \u2018Commissioner\u2019 means the Commissioner of Census, \u2018Deputy Commissioner\u2019 means the Deputy Commissioner of Census \u2018Assistant Commissioner\u2019 means the Assistant Commissioner of Census (Superintendent of Census and Commissioners of Census have been published by the Extraordinary Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 2264/8 dated 25th January 2022.) In addition to that, the o\ufb03 cers who are involved in the census duties are also meant as \u2018Census O\ufb03 cer\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      506.22,
      479.53,
      574.23
    ],
    "text": "PART II \u2013 GENERAL 1. Enumeration stage of the Population and Housing Census \u2013 2024 shall be conducted as follows. ProcessTime Frame",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.56,
      579.48,
      322.76,
      632.55
    ],
    "text": "(i)Collecting information about persons according to the usual place of residence and collecting housing information by using tablet computers or \u201cAndroid\u201d mobile devices or a web form",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      348.22,
      579.48,
      474.85,
      590.55
    ],
    "text": "October 2024 - December 2024",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      104.78,
      651.28,
      424.32,
      662.35
    ],
    "text": "(ii)Date of Census19 December 2024",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      102.0,
      680.52,
      508.74,
      691.59
    ],
    "text": "(iii)Revision Round 19 December 2024 - 23 December 2024",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.0,
      698.48,
      322.76,
      737.55
    ],
    "text": "Enumeration by revising the information of usual residents based on date of the Census and the Census moment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      77.59,
      84.31,
      545.04,
      108.67
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'10'28P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.10.2024 3A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      114.22,
      549.75,
      139.29
    ],
    "text": "2. Information related to the enumeration stage should be provided by every person, to the Census O\ufb03 cers appointed to the area concerned by the Superintendent or Commissioner.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      156.22,
      549.77,
      181.29
    ],
    "text": "3. Supervising o\ufb03 cers appointed by the Superintendent or Commissioner shall check the status of the information entered in the devices and other forms related to the enumeration stage.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      198.53,
      207.22,
      411.63,
      218.29
    ],
    "text": "PART III \u2013 DUTY OF THE CENSUS OFFICERS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      235.22,
      549.77,
      288.29
    ],
    "text": "1. Any power or duty delegated or entrusted on the Superintendent by the Ordinance or any rule made there, under the general or special direction of the Superintendent, may be exercised or performed by a Deputy Superintendent of Census throughout the Island or by a Deputy / Assistant Superintendent of Census in the area of his / her authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      305.22,
      549.77,
      344.29
    ],
    "text": "2. Any power or duty delegated or entrusted on a Commissioner by the Ordinance or any rule made thereunder may be exercised or performed by a Deputy / Assistant Commissioner within the area for which he/she is appointed, under the general or special direction of the Commissioner of that area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      361.22,
      549.77,
      400.29
    ],
    "text": "3. Every Census O\ufb03 cer shall attend the instruction classes or inspections on the dates and at times and places directed by the in charge of Superintendent or Commissioner or the Deputy / Assistant Commissioner of the area for which he/she is appointed as a Census O\ufb03 cer.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      417.22,
      549.78,
      456.29
    ],
    "text": "4. A Census O\ufb03 cer employed for the purpose of enumeration duties shall not, except in connection with that usual service, divulge or communicate to any other person, without lawful authority, any information obtained by him for the purpose of completing a schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      473.22,
      549.78,
      512.29
    ],
    "text": "5. A Census O\ufb03 cer employed for the purpose of enumeration duties shall not disclose the information contained in the tablet computer or mobile devices or forms or other documents relating to the enumeration duties, devices or other documents to any unauthorized person until those are in his/her custody.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      529.22,
      549.76,
      554.29
    ],
    "text": "6. Every Census O\ufb03 cer employed for the purpose of taking any Census duties should make and sign the following oath or a\ufb03 rmation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      571.22,
      549.77,
      680.29
    ],
    "text": "I, \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026., sincerely and truly a\ufb03 rm and declare that I will faithfully and honestly ful\ufb01 ll my duties as \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 in conformity with the requirements of the Census Ordinance and all rules made thereunder, and that I will not, without due authority on that behalf, publish or communicate any information which I may obtain in the course of my employment as a Census O\ufb03 cer. .................................. Signature Before me.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      694.22,
      178.75,
      705.29
    ],
    "text": "Place : \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026...........",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
