    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'10'28P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.10.2024 4A",
