      139.29
    ],
    "text": "7. Every Census O\ufb03 cer holding a post which is not below the rank of a Supervising O\ufb03 cer may obtain the oath or certi\ufb01 cate statement mentioned under the preceding article from any other Census O\ufb03 cer.",
