    ],
    "text": "2. A Census O\ufb03 cer may obtain the information necessary for the Census by asking questions relating to the particulars prescribed in rule I in this Section from all persons within his/her area regarding themselves as the persons constituting their respective households or by arranging the particulars to be entered by such persons on prescribed forms.",
